        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thanks! `line:find` is working great. And yeah, I'm not very happy with issues where the comment is within a string. I think I could probably write some messy implementation to ignore the result if it was found within `'` or `\"`, using some balanced logic, which would get rid of 99% of false positives. For now, though, it'll do for my personal config.",
            "created_at": "2025-06-26T21:32:42Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/1431#issuecomment-3010197974",
            "id": 3010197974,
